@startuml
!theme plain

title System Scope Frame — msocial

rectangle "Внутри системы (In Scope)" as InScope #LightGreen {
    rectangle "msocial Backend" as Backend #White {
        card "REST API" as API
        card "Auth Service\n(JWT + OIDC)" as Auth
        card "Profile Service" as Profile
        card "Post Service" as Post
        card "Comment Service" as Comment
        card "Group Service" as Group
    }
    database "PostgreSQL" as DB #LightYellow
    storage "Local File\nStorage" as Storage #LightYellow
}

rectangle "За пределами системы (Out of Scope)" as OutScope #LightCoral {
    cloud "Matrix Server\n(Synapse/Dendrite)" as Matrix
    actor "Пользователь\n(Клиент)" as Client
    actor "Администратор\nгруппы" as Admin
    cloud "Push\nNotification\nService" as Push
    card "E2EE\n(Клиент)" as E2EE
}

Client --> API : HTTP REST
Admin --> API : HTTP REST
API --> Auth
API --> Profile
API --> Post
API --> Comment
API --> Group

Auth --> Matrix : OIDC verify
Auth --> DB : sessions
Profile --> DB : users
Post --> DB : posts
Comment --> DB : comments
Group --> DB : groups

Profile --> Storage : avatars
Post --> Storage : media

Matrix ..> Client : federation
Client ..> E2EE
Push ..> Client

note right of InScope
  **Внутри системы:**
  • REST API (Spring Boot)
  • Аутентификация и авторизация
  • Бизнес-логика (PCMEF)
  • PostgreSQL + File Storage
  • TypeScript SDK
end note

note right of OutScope
  **За пределами:**
  • Matrix-сервер (Synapse)
  • Клиентские приложения
  • Push-уведомления
  • E2E-шифрование
end note

@enduml